WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Phunziroli likusonyeza mbali za disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona.

00:00:38.123 --> 00:00:58.123
Mawu pa chithunzi asonyeza mphete ya minofu yozungulira dzenje.

00:01:16.247 --> 00:01:36.247
Chithunzi chikuyerekezera mulifupi mwa dzenje ndi mulifupi mwa disiki yonse.
